  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Ho Chi Minh City Integrated Emergency Communications System, through Winbourne &amp; Costas, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This technical assistance (TA) grant partially funds the development of an integrated Emergency Communications System (ECS) for Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam. The TA will assist the Ho Chi Minh City&apos;s Department of Information and Communications (HCMC DIC) and the Ho I Minh City People&apos;s Committee to develop a unified and integrated ECS, in order to significantly reduce potential damage and material loss, and decrease loss of life during fire, police, and health emergencies. The TA is being performed on a sole-source basis by the U.S. firm Winbourne Consulting, LLC.</narrative>
  </description>
